<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>No major South African company results are due out next week, other than December gold quarterly results from three mining firms.</p>
<p>These are Gencor Ltd on Monday, JCI Ltd on Tueday and Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd on Thursday. Analysts see industry-wide December quarter earnings up nine to 13 percent.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
